/color>时，进入<color=Highlight><te href=110807>预求身</te></color>。<color=Highlight><te href=110807>预求身</te></color>期间，解锁全新的战斗形态，可通过特定技能回复<color=Highlight>【<te href=110802>寒意</te>】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>居合架势</color></size>\n若<color=Highlight>【<te href=110802>寒意</te>】</color>不低于100点时进行以下操作，绯雪会消耗耐力向后瞬身，进入<color=Highlight>【居合架势】</color>：\n·施放除<color=Highlight>重击·枯霜·预求身</color>以外的<color=Highlight>常态攻击·预求身</color>、<color=Highlight>霜罚·白玉切</color>、<color=Highlight>霜罚·落华</color>、<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>、<color=Highlight>变奏技能·霜锋</color>后短按<color=Highlight>闪避</color>。\n·施放<color=Highlight>霜罚·白玉切</color>、<color=Highlight>霜罚·落华</color>后一定时间内长按<color=Highlight>共鸣技能</color>。\n进行上述操作时，若按住向前方向，且技能目标在一定范围内，绯雪会消耗耐力瞬身至敌人身后，进入<color=Highlight>【居合架势】</color>。\n绯雪在空中时可以进入<color=Highlight>【居合架势】</color>。进入<color=Highlight>【居合架势】</color>时，重置空中闪避次数。<color=Highlight>【居合架势】</color>期间，若切换至其他角色则提前退出。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>普攻·居合</color></size>\n施放<color=Highlight>【居合架势】</color>后一定时间内，短按<color=Highlight>普攻</color>可以消耗100点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110802>寒意</te>】</color>，施放<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>，造成<color=Ice>冷凝伤害</color>，此次伤害为共鸣解放伤害。\n若施放后<color=Highlight>【<te href=110802>寒意</te>】</color>仍不低于100点，一定时间内可以短按<color=Highlight>普攻</color>再次施放<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>。\n若施放<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>的一定时间内受到敌方目标攻击，免疫此次伤害，随后一定时间内免疫打断且受到的伤害降低100%。\n每次施放<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>期间，若拥有<color=Highlight>【<te href=110803>武霜·居合</te>】</color>，绯雪会消耗1点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110803>武霜·居合</te>】</color>，使本次<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>为命中的目标附加3次<color=Highlight>【<te href=850010>霜渐效应</te>】</color>，同时绯雪获得1层<color=Highlight>【<te href=110804>淬寒·枯霜</te>】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>心念</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【<te href=110801>心念</te>】</color>上限300点。\n<color=Highlight>常世身</color>期间，可通过以下方式回复<color=Highlight>【<te href=110801>心念</te>】</color>：\n·施放<color=Highlight>普攻·常世身第3段</color>时，回复100点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110801>心念</te>】</color>。\n·施放<color=Highlight>变奏技能·霜锋</color>时，回复200点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110801>心念</te>】</color>。\n·施放<color=Highlight>共鸣技能·常世身</color>时，使下一次<color=Highlight>普攻·常世身第3段</color>获得强化：施放时额外回复100点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110801>心念</te>】</color>，若切换至其他角色则失去该效果。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>寒意</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【<te href=110802>寒意</te>】</color>上限300点。\n施放<color=Highlight>霜罚·白玉切</color>、<color=Highlight>霜罚·落华</color>期间，或是除<color=Highlight>重击·枯霜·预求身</color>以外的<color=Highlight>常态攻击·预求身</color>命中目标时，回复<color=Highlight>【<te href=110802>寒意</te>】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>武霜·居合</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【<te href=110803>武霜·居合</te>】</color>上限3点。\n施放<color=Highlight>预求我身·见心</color>时获得3点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110803>武霜·居合</te>】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>淬寒·枯霜</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【<te href=110804>淬寒·枯霜</te>】</color>上限3层。\n每次通过施放<color=Highlight>普攻·居合</color>消耗<color=Highlight>【<te href=110803>武霜·居合</te>】</color>时，获得1层<color=Highlight>【<te href=110804>淬寒·枯霜</te>】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>锻雪·归刃</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【<te href=110805>锻雪·归刃</te>】</color>上限3点。\n每次施放<color=Highlight>重击·枯霜·预求身</color>期间，获得1点<color=Highlight>【<te href=110805>锻雪·归刃</te>】</color>。","values":[["普攻·居合伤害","283.82%+47.31%*4","冷凝","1.88","63.47"],["居合架势耐力消耗","20","",null,null]],"damage":{"11081220010":{"element":1,"related_property":"攻击","type":2,"rate_lv":[14276,15447,16618,18256,19427,20773,22646,24519,26392,28382,30723,33065,35406,37747,40088,42430,44771,47112,49453,51795],"energy":112,"element_power":215,"hardness_lv":10000,"tough_lv":4759,"weakness_lvl":3807},"11081220020":{"element":1,"related_property":"攻击","type":2,"rate_lv":[2380,2575,2770,3043,3238,3463,3775,4087,4399,4731,5121,5511,5901,6292,6682,7072,7462,7852,8243,8633],"energy":19,"element_power":36,"hardness_lv":10000,"tough_lv":794,"weakness_lvl":635},"11081220030":{"element":1,"related_property":"攻击